title: The Assembly Reconvenes
subtitle: Staal's first test has come.
view-if: chancellor = "Staal" and next_reichstag_time == rubicon_time and next_reichstag_time > 0
on-arrival: reichstag_rubicon = 1; reichstag_staal_seen = 1
new-page: true
tags: event
max-visits: 1
priority: 2
on-display: {!  
    var cardEl = document.createElement('div');  
    cardEl.className = "face-figure2";  

    var image = new Image();  
    image.className = "face-img";  
    image.src = "img/reichstag.jpg";  

    cardEl.appendChild(image);  
    var contentDiv = document.querySelector("#page #mid_panel #content");
    contentDiv.appendChild(cardEl);
!}

= Assembly Reconvenes

Staal’s first test with the Assembly comes immediately after his appointment, and he's expected to lose by a wide margin. To head off defeat, he offered Garrick Crowde of the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**Royalists**</span> the vice chancellorship and control of Heartland, hoping Crowde could persuade the party to tolerate his government. However, [+ royalist_leader +] would only accept the obedient Gorrick as leader.

Nonetheless, despite the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**Royalists**</span>’s uncompromising stance, they are seeking a respite—pushing for an early holiday recess and delaying any immediate showdown with the newly appointed cabinet.

- @reichstag

@reichstag
title: The <span style="color: #700000;">**Collectivists**</span> put forth a motion of no confidence.
on-arrival: pro_republic += 5

The motion is defeated! In a surprise to the public, the <span style="color: #700000;">**Collectivist**</span> proposal to prioritize a no-confidence vote is voted down—thanks to support from the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Royalists</span>. But this is no act of reconciliation; it’s certainly not the toleration Staal deludes himself into believing stems from his connections with Crowde.

In any case, after clearing a few remaining bills, the chamber agrees to a holiday recess of indefinite duration.

- @reichstag_2

@reichstag_2
title: Goodryke's decree on wages is repealed!
on-arrival: commons_collectivist -= 4; disfavored_collectivist -= 4; commons_unionist += 2; commons_marcher += 2; disfavored_marcher += 4; pro_republic += 3; reichstag_break = 1; reichstag_rubicon = 0; oskar_goal = "Scheme against Staal"; papen_goal = "Scheme against Staal"; staal_approval += 1

Staal has given his consent for the Assembly to repeal one of Goodryke's more egregious decrees that had particularly offended the Free Guilds, as part of his prior promise and to calm their fury against the government. 